# 301 redirects — old Wix site -> new site structure
# Format (Cloudflare Pages): /old-path  /new-path  301   (first match wins)
# Source: live Wix sitemaps (pages, en_en, nl_nl) captured 2026-07-18.
# NOTE: this file is Cloudflare Pages' redirect mechanism. .htaccess is ignored here.

# ---- Home ----
# Bare domain -> French (x-default). Remove this line to keep the JS language
# auto-detect selector that index.html renders at the root instead.
